{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations, you\u2019ve landed a job as a 'Dungeon QA tester'. Your employer - a cat with a questionable sense of humor, who\u2019s turned chaos into a business model. Here, spells are your lifeline and arcane missiles come in unrelenting waves. As a <strong>Spellweaver</strong>, you\u2019ll craft custom spells, dodge bullet-hell nightmares, and try not to give the Dungeon Architect any reason to doubt your credentials.\u00a0Wishlist <strong>spellloom</strong> now to stay updated on the latest developments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's see what your new employer has to say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/cat.gif?t=1745135764\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/combat_1.gif?t=1745135764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, <strong>Combat</strong>. Hope you enjoy weaving through a storm of magical projectiles - because that's basically your life now.\u00a0Concentrated action. Every encounter is a chaotic ballet of fireballs, lasers, and creatures with entirely too many teeth. You'll dodge, you'll shoot, and maybe you'll even survive. Try to look confident out there; I find panic so boring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting &amp; Spellweaving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/craft.gif?t=1745135764\" />You want to play with magic? Fine. I've given you the <strong>Spellbinder</strong> \u2013 a fancy grimoire that lets you stitch spells together however you like. Slot in shiny spell components (<i>Essences, Aspects... big words, I know</i>) to customize your two spells on the fly. Think chain lightning, AoE bursts, bouncing shots, or protective shields - whatever magical concoctions you piece together. Go on, impress me with your little experiments (and try not to set yourself on fire in the process).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/exploration.gif?t=1745135764\" />My dungeon is ever-changing (I'm indecisive, so what?). No two runs are the same, so don't bother memorizing layouts. You\u2019ll wander through shadowy halls, enchanted rooms, and whatever other corridors I dream up to keep things interesting. Some of them might even help you out - find a secret or a shop and consider it a courtesy before the next onslaught. It's challenging, but I'm not trying to crush your spirit in one go; if you die too fast, I'd have to find a new tester.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, that's the tour. Off you go, <strong>Spellweaver</strong>\u00a0- the dungeon won't test itself. I suppose I could wish you luck, but honestly... it makes no difference to me.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587900?t=1745135764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/43befa0b4e13fb76d366aafa8668b9ebf56f74dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745135764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/6dca8a8af8b39d2b0dbd930f6fd0090fd1ae2bb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745135764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/6dca8a8af8b39d2b0dbd930f6fd0090fd1ae2bb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745135764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3608040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations, you\u2019ve landed a job as a 'Dungeon QA tester'. Your employer - a cat with a questionable sense of humor, who\u2019s turned chaos into a business model. Here, spells are your lifeline and arcane missiles come in unrelenting waves. As a <strong>Spellweaver</strong>, you\u2019ll craft custom spells, dodge bullet-hell nightmares, and try not to give the Dungeon Architect any reason to doubt your credentials.\u00a0Wishlist <strong>spellloom</strong> now to stay updated on the latest developments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's see what your new employer has to say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/cat.gif?t=1745135764\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/combat_1.gif?t=1745135764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, <strong>Combat</strong>. Hope you enjoy weaving through a storm of magical projectiles - because that's basically your life now.\u00a0Concentrated action. Every encounter is a chaotic ballet of fireballs, lasers, and creatures with entirely too many teeth. You'll dodge, you'll shoot, and maybe you'll even survive. Try to look confident out there; I find panic so boring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crafting &amp; Spellweaving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/craft.gif?t=1745135764\" />You want to play with magic? Fine. I've given you the <strong>Spellbinder</strong> \u2013 a fancy grimoire that lets you stitch spells together however you like. Slot in shiny spell components (<i>Essences, Aspects... big words, I know</i>) to customize your two spells on the fly. Think chain lightning, AoE bursts, bouncing shots, or protective shields - whatever magical concoctions you piece together. Go on, impress me with your little experiments (and try not to set yourself on fire in the process).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/extras/exploration.gif?t=1745135764\" />My dungeon is ever-changing (I'm indecisive, so what?). No two runs are the same, so don't bother memorizing layouts. You\u2019ll wander through shadowy halls, enchanted rooms, and whatever other corridors I dream up to keep things interesting. Some of them might even help you out - find a secret or a shop and consider it a courtesy before the next onslaught. It's challenging, but I'm not trying to crush your spirit in one go; if you die too fast, I'd have to find a new tester.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, that's the tour. Off you go, <strong>Spellweaver</strong>\u00a0- the dungeon won't test itself. I suppose I could wish you luck, but honestly... it makes no difference to me.</p>","developers":["Byte Jazz Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587900/dc515e4c4dc497685052f5f2aed388c9447a54d5/header.jpg?t=1745135764","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113110,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113110/movie480.mp4?t=1742580899","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113110/movie_max.mp4?t=1742580899"},"name":"spelllooo